codex --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `grevo fork`, `grevo exec`, and `grevo exec fork`
codex fork --worktree: `grevo fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
codex fork --worktree --last: `grevo fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
codex exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `grevo exec fork --worktree`
codex exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
codex resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `grevo fork`, `grevo exec`, and `grevo exec fork`
codex archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `grevo fork`, `grevo exec`, and `grevo exec fork`
codex queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `grevo fork`, `grevo exec`, and `grevo exec fork`
